# Paranal Airglow Line And Continuum Emission (PALACE) model: data and code of
# v1.0 (Noll et al. 2024)
# 
# 2D reference climatologies of relative intensity, solar cycle effect, and
# residual variability for PALACE variability class OH3a
# (see pmd_climfeat.dat for the lines/multiplets/features involved in the
# calculation of the weighted averages of the climatological properties)
# 
# Column names:
# mbin: month bin
# cDOY: central day of year
# hbin: LT bin
# cLT: central LT (for longitude of Cerro Paranal)
# wbin: weight of bin (LT fraction with solar zenith angle > 100°)
# N: size of subsample
# r: radius for subsample selection relative to 1 month and 1 hour
# I: intensity relative to climatological mean
# SCE: solar cycle effect per 100 sfu relative to mean intensity of subsample
# dSCE: uncertainty of solar cycle effect
# dI: standard deviation of residuals relative to mean intensity of subsample
# 
# Note: consistent with class-related content in palace_var.fits
# 
